From 29d296ccb6abe6de053782675c1bccfe06bdf417 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:08:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 193/193] webrender: link again what the SGX530 refuses at
 random on ES 2.0

The PowerVR SGX530's driver (DDK 1.17) refuses now and then a program
whose vertex and fragment shaders read the same sampler ("Uniform
variable sGpuBufferF type/precision does not match"), a different
program on each run: brush_blend, ps_quad_gradient or cs_svg_filter_node
out of 51 variants. Linking the same program again fails again; shaders
compiled afresh into a new program link (measured with gles2-link on the
device).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 gfx/wr/webrender/src/device/gl.rs | 151 +++++++++++++++++-------------
 1 file changed, 85 insertions(+), 66 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gfx/wr/webrender/src/device/gl.rs b/gfx/wr/webrender/src/device/gl.rs
index 47fc3cbf3505..afbd1cd7f13e 100644
